sequenceDiagram
    participant Request as Registration request
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant UI as Operations UI
    Request->>DB: Read saturation and queue length
    DB-->>Request: Surge indicators
    Request->>DB: set_system_status(lite_mode)
    DB-->>UI: Polled status
    UI->>UI: Reduce non-critical telemetry and animations
    Request->>DB: Preserve locked seat allocation
